sa1.doYouHaveANino.title = National Insurance number
sa1.doYouHaveANino.heading = National Insurance number
sa1.doYouHaveANino.p1 = You only need a National Insurance number if you intend to:
sa1.doYouHaveANino.b1 = work
sa1.doYouHaveANino.b2 = claim benefits
sa1.doYouHaveANino.b3 = apply for a student loan
sa1.doYouHaveANino.b4 = pay Class 3 voluntary National Insurance contributions
sa1.doYouHaveANino.p2 = If none of these apply to you, you can still register for Self Assessment without one. You can <a href="{0}" class="govuk-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{1}</a>.
sa1.doYouHaveANino.p2.linkText = find your National Insurance number (opens in a new tab)
sa1.doYouHaveANino.subHeading = Do you have a National Insurance number?
sa1.doYouHaveANino.checkYourAnswersLabel = Do you have a National Insurance number?
sa1.doYouHaveANino.error.required = Select yes if you have a National Insurance number
sa1.doYouHaveANino.change.hidden = Do you have a National Insurance number?

